---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study: AI-Powered Design Workflow"
  description="How EvansMathibe built a custom AI system that reduced design iteration time by 40% for a Johannesburg creative agency."
  image="/logo.png"
>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="tag">AI Automation</span>
      <span class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Case Study</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">AI-Powered Design Workflow</h1>
    <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-lg mb-8">How we reduced design iteration time by 40% through automated mockup generation.</p>

    <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 mb-12">
      <img src="/images/Generated_image_1_-_2025-11-17T184214.269.png" alt="AI Workflow Demo" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          A creative agency was spending an average of 3 weeks on design iterations per campaign.
          Manual mockup generation, variant testing, and client feedback loops were consuming
          60% of the team's productive capacity. The bottleneck wasn't talent — it was the
          repetitive computational work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We built a custom AI workflow that handles the initial mockup generation, variant creation,
          and first-round client feedback processing. The system uses image generation models
          fine-tuned on the client's brand guidelines to produce on-brand outputs instantly.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Fine-tuned image generation on brand color palettes and typography</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Automated variant creation for different channels and formats</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>AI-powered client feedback parsing and iteration tracking</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Results</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The client went from 3-week design cycles to 10-day cycles. The creative team regained
          capacity to focus on strategic direction and original concept work.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">40%</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Faster iteration</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">60%</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Less manual work</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">3x</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">More concepts produced</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Start Your AI Automation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>